[h1]Material Alchemy[/h1]

Adds configurable material-conversion recipes to Elin.

[h2]Added Recipes[/h2]

[b]Alchemy Table[/b]
[list]
[*]Rock → Ore
[*]Rock → Fiber
[*]Rock → Fragment
[*]Rock → Log
[*]Rock → Shining Ore
[*]Ore → Rock
[*]Fiber → Rock
[*]Fragment → Rock
[*]Log → Rock
[*]Shining Ore → Rock
[/list]

[b]Blacksmith Table[/b]
[list]
[*]Ingot → Scrap
[*]Ingots → Material Hammer
[/list]

[b]Smelter[/b]
[list]
[*]Scrap → Ingot
[/list]

[b]Gem Cutter[/b]
[list]
[*]Sun Crystal → Shining Ore
[*]Earth Crystal → Shining Ore
[*]Mana Crystal → Shining Ore
[/list]

[b]Wood Cutter[/b]
[list]
[*]Plank → Stick x2
[/list]

[h2]Configuration[/h2]

Every added recipe can be enabled or disabled individually in the config.

The Material Hammer recipe is disabled by default. All other recipes are enabled by default.

The Material Hammer recipe also has a configurable ingot requirement for balancing purposes.

For easier configuration, use [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3379819704]Mod Config GUI[/url].